Sammy and the other children.

00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:21.868
Andrew Gallagher. Ava Wilson.

00:00:21.868 --> 00:00:23.368
I didn't hurt anybody. Not yet.

00:00:23.868 --> 00:00:26.568
Max, your abilities started
seven months ago, right?

00:00:26.568 --> 00:00:27.368
How'd you know that?

00:00:27.368 --> 00:00:28.868
The same thing killed our mothers.

00:00:32.168 --> 00:00:32.968
You and I were chosen.

00:00:32.968 --> 00:00:34.068
For what? I don't know.

00:00:38.668 --> 00:00:41.168
I saw this guy die
days before it happened.

00:00:41.168 --> 00:00:42.968
You can make people
do things, can't you?

00:00:42.968 --> 00:00:43.968
You can tell them what to think.

00:00:44.468 --> 00:00:46.868
Cherry ride. Can I have it? Sure, man.

00:00:51.068 --> 00:00:51.768
You must be one of us.

00:00:52.568 --> 00:00:53.268
Who? The psychics.

00:00:53.268 --> 00:00:56.068
Screw you, buddy, 'cause
i'm a secretary from peoria,

00:00:56.068 --> 00:00:56.868
And i'm not part of anything.

00:00:57.268 --> 00:00:59.268
This demon tells me they have soldiers

00:00:59.268 --> 00:01:00.668
To fight in this coming war

00:01:00.968 --> 00:01:02.668
Psychics fighting on hell's side.

00:01:03.368 --> 00:01:06.568
The yellow-Eyed man tells me
to do things -- Awful things.

00:01:06.568 --> 00:01:08.368
He told me he's got big plans.

00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:11.168
Maybe this is his plan. Maybe
we're all supposed to be --

00:01:11.168 --> 00:01:12.568
What, killers? Give me a break.

00:01:12.568 --> 00:01:13.968
No one's heard anything about Ava.

00:01:13.968 --> 00:01:15.868
She's just -- Into
thin air, you know?

00:01:19.768 --> 00:01:20.868
Sulfur. Ava.

00:01:20.868 --> 00:01:21.868
Demon's been here.

00:01:21.868 --> 00:01:23.968
If something bad's
coming, it's coming fast,

00:01:23.968 --> 00:01:25.468
And their side holds all the cards.

00:01:25.668 --> 00:01:28.468
We can't run from this,
and you can't protect me.

00:01:28.668 --> 00:01:31.268
Damn it, Sam, this whole thing
is spinning out of control.

00:01:49.368 --> 00:01:51.168
Hey, don't forget the
extra onions this time, huh?

00:01:51.968 --> 00:01:54.968
Dude, i'm the one who's
gonna have to ride in the car

00:01:54.968 --> 00:01:56.068
With your extra onions.

00:01:59.268 --> 00:02:00.368
Hey, see if they got any pie.

00:02:02.568 --> 00:02:03.468
Bring me some pie!

00:02:06.468 --> 00:02:07.468
Bring me some pie.

00:02:52.868 --> 00:02:53.668
Sam?

00:03:35.068 --> 00:03:35.868
Sulfur

00:03:38.268 --> 00:03:39.268
Sam!

00:03:39.468 --> 00:03:40.268
Sammy!

00:03:42.668 --> 00:03:43.668
Sam!

00:03:46.668 --> 00:03:47.568
Sammy!

00:03:54.068 --> 00:03:55.868
Sam!

00:05:57.668 --> 00:05:58.868
Andy? Sam.

00:05:59.368 --> 00:06:00.568
What are you doing here? I don't know.

00:06:00.568 --> 00:06:02.068
What am I doing here? I don't know.

00:06:02.268 --> 00:06:03.668
Where are we?

00:06:03.668 --> 00:06:04.968
Andy, look, calm down.

00:06:05.868 --> 00:06:06.568
I can't calm down.

00:06:06.568 --> 00:06:09.868
I just woke up in
freaking frontier land.

00:06:09.868 --> 00:06:11.068
What's the last thing you remember?

00:06:13.268 --> 00:06:16.668
Honestly, my fourth bong load.

00:06:18.268 --> 00:06:19.168
It was weird.

00:06:20.168 --> 00:06:20.968
All of a sudden,

00:06:21.768 --> 00:06:24.668
There was this really
intense smell, like a...

00:06:25.568 --> 00:06:26.368
Like sulfur?

00:06:27.268 --> 00:06:27.968
How did you know that?

00:06:29.668 --> 00:06:30.268
Dean.

00:06:30.268 --> 00:06:31.568
Your brother -- Is
he -- Is he here?

00:06:32.568 --> 00:06:33.668
I don't know where he is.

00:06:35.568 --> 00:06:36.468
I don't know if he's...

00:06:43.268 --> 00:06:44.168
Hello?

00:06:45.068 --> 00:06:47.368
Woman: no! Help me!

00:06:48.168 --> 00:06:49.568
Okay, okay, i'm here.

00:06:49.568 --> 00:06:50.568
We're gonna get you out, all right?

00:06:50.968 --> 00:06:51.968
Just hold on a second.

00:06:59.868 --> 00:07:00.868
All right, one second.

00:07:03.968 --> 00:07:07.168
Ava? Oh, my god! Sam!

00:07:07.168 --> 00:07:08.068
Hey.

00:07:10.068 --> 00:07:10.868
So, I guess you guys know each other.

00:07:12.068 --> 00:07:12.968
Yeah.

00:07:12.968 --> 00:07:15.068
How did you -- I
mean, how did --

00:07:15.068 --> 00:07:16.268
Ava, have you been here this whole time?

00:07:16.568 --> 00:07:19.568
What whole time? I just woke
up in there a half an hour ago.

00:07:19.568 --> 00:07:21.068
Well, you've been gone for five months.

00:07:21.068 --> 00:07:22.868
My brother and I have been
looking for you everywhere.

00:07:23.768 --> 00:07:25.868
That's impossible 'cause
I saw you two days ago.

00:07:25.868 --> 00:07:27.268
You didn't. I'm sorry.

00:07:28.968 --> 00:07:32.568
But that makes no sense. It's...not...

00:07:32.568 --> 00:07:36.368
Oh, my god! My fianc? Brady.

00:07:36.368 --> 00:07:39.268
If I've been missing for that
long, he must be freaking out!

00:07:41.168 --> 00:07:42.068
Well...

00:07:42.068 --> 00:07:42.968
Oh!

00:07:44.868 --> 00:07:45.668
Hey.

00:07:47.268 --> 00:07:49.268
