freaking out.

00:07:50.268 --> 00:07:51.268
Okay.

00:07:51.668 --> 00:07:52.768
What's happening?

00:07:54.268 --> 00:07:55.168
Well, I, uh...

00:07:55.568 --> 00:07:57.568
