00:08:04.868 --> 00:08:05.668
Wait.

00:08:09.068 --> 00:08:09.868
Hello?

00:08:10.468 --> 00:08:11.068
Hey!

00:08:12.568 --> 00:08:13.468
Hey, you guys all right?

00:08:14.368 --> 00:08:15.268
Think so.

00:08:15.468 --> 00:08:16.368
I'm Sam.

00:08:16.868 --> 00:08:18.468
I'm Jake. Lily.

00:08:18.968 --> 00:08:19.768
Are there any more of you?

00:08:20.068 --> 00:08:20.968
No.

00:08:20.968 --> 00:08:21.968
How did we even get here?

00:08:21.968 --> 00:08:23.568
A minute ago, I was in san diego.

00:08:23.868 --> 00:08:25.269
Well, if it makes you feel any better,

00:08:25.769 --> 00:08:27.968
I went to sleep last
night in Afghanistan.

00:08:29.468 --> 00:08:31.568
