Like, anything I want.

00:09:02.968 --> 00:09:04.769
It's like bam! People, they see it.

00:09:05.068 --> 00:09:08.368
This one guy I know -- Total
dick -- I used it on him.

00:09:09.769 --> 00:09:12.368
Gay porn all hours of the day.

00:09:13.269 --> 00:09:14.269
It's just like...

00:09:14.269 --> 00:09:16.168
