the look on his face.

00:09:27.468 --> 00:09:29.769
You go, "simon says give me
your wallet," and they do?

00:09:30.269 --> 00:09:32.468
You have visions? That's great.

00:09:32.468 --> 00:09:34.068
I'd kill for something like that.

00:09:34.068 --> 00:09:35.769
Lily, listen, it's okay.

00:09:35.769 --> 00:09:36.769
No, it's not.

00:09:36.769 --> 00:09:40.168
I touch people. Their hearts stop.

00:09:41.168 --> 00:09:42.568
I can barely leave my house.

00:09:42.968 --> 00:09:44.468
My life's not exactly improved.

00:09:45.468 --> 00:09:48.168
So screw you. I just want to go home.

00:09:48.168 --> 00:09:49.269
And we don't?

00:09:49.269 --> 00:09:50.868
Don't -- Hey,
gs, come on.

00:09:50.868 --> 00:09:53.168
Look, whether we like it
or not, we're all here,

00:09:53.168 --> 00:09:55.068
And so we all have to deal with this.

00:09:55.468 --> 00:09:56.868
Who brought us h here?

00:09:59.168 --> 00:10:01.668
It's less of a "who."
It's more of a "what."

00:10:02.068 --> 00:10:03.168
What does that mean?

00:10:05.668 --> 00:10:06.468
It's, uh...

00:10:09.568 --> 00:10:10.368
