and omens over the past month.

00:10:19.468 --> 00:10:20.468
Are you joking? There's nothing here.

00:10:20.968 --> 00:10:21.668
Exactly.

00:10:22.668 --> 00:10:23.868
Come on, there's got to be something.

00:10:23.868 --> 00:10:25.668
