Sam, close our eyes and point?

00:10:38.368 --> 00:10:39.269
Sam: Ash, what do you got?

00:10:39.269 --> 00:10:42.269
Okay, listen. It's a
bit negatory on Sam.

00:10:42.568 --> 00:10:44.168
Come on, man. You got
to give us something.

00:10:44.168 --> 00:10:46.068
We're looking at a
3,000-Mile haystack here.

00:10:46.468 --> 00:10:49.868
Listen, Dean. I did find something.

00:10:50.468 --> 00:10:51.168
Well, what?

00:10:52.368 --> 00:10:53.868
I can't talk over this line, Dean.

00:10:54.168 --> 00:10:55.368
Come on, I don't have time for this.

00:10:55.468 --> 00:10:57.468
Make time, ok, cause this..

00:10:58.668 --> 00:11:00.868
