00:14:16.468 --> 00:14:18.568
Lily, we don't know what's going on yet.

00:14:18.568 --> 00:14:20.968
We don't even know how
many of them are out there.

00:14:20.968 --> 00:14:22.368
Yeah, he's right.
We should --

