I accidentally touched my girlfriend.

00:14:41.668 --> 00:14:42.468
I'm sorry.

00:14:43.769 --> 00:14:44.668
Whatever.

00:14:45.668 --> 00:14:47.269
I feel like i'm in a nightmare,

00:14:47.269 --> 00:14:49.468
