Salt is a weapon?

00:15:21.769 --> 00:15:22.868
It's a brave, new world.

00:15:23.568 --> 00:15:25.368
Hopefully, there's food in your world,

00:15:25.368 --> 00:15:26.568
'Cause i'm freaking starving.

