00:18:03.568 --> 00:18:04.969
I haven't eaten since...

00:18:06.568 --> 00:18:07.469
Well, who knows.

00:18:08.868 --> 00:18:09.568
No,
it's --

00:18:09.568 --> 00:18:10.868
Don't worry, i'm fine,

00:18:11.368 --> 00:18:13.769
Except for every single
thing that's happening.

00:18:15.769 --> 00:18:17.769
You guys, I found something!

00:18:25.168 --> 00:18:26.068
Salt.

