It's hard to explain.

00:20:13.368 --> 00:20:14.269
All right.

00:20:17.668 --> 00:20:18.368
This is...

00:20:18.969 --> 00:20:20.168
What the hell did Ash know?

00:20:21.368 --> 00:20:24.269
We got no way of knowing where
Ellen is or if she's even alive.

00:20:24.868 --> 00:20:26.269
We got no clue what
Ash was gonna tell us.

00:20:26.269 --> 00:20:27.568
Now, how the hell are we gonna find Sam?

00:20:28.568 --> 00:20:29.368
We'll find him.

00:20:31.668 --> 00:20:32.469
Dean? No!

00:20:33.368 --> 00:20:34.168
Unh!

00:20:37.568 --> 00:20:39.469
Unh!

00:20:42.368 --> 00:20:43.068
What was that?

00:20:46.769 --> 00:20:47.969
I don't know. Headache?

00:20:48.668 --> 00:20:50.068
You get headaches like that a lot?

00:20:51.469 --> 00:20:52.368
No.

00:20:55.368 --> 00:20:56.368
It must be the stress.

00:20:59.668 --> 00:21:01.769
I could have swore I saw something.

00:21:01.769 --> 00:21:04.068
What do you mean?
Like -- Like a vision?

00:21:04.068 --> 00:21:06.469
Like what Sam gets? What? No.

00:21:06.469 --> 00:21:07.568
I'm just saying.

00:21:07.568 --> 00:21:08.668
Come on, i'm not some psychic.

00:21:11.868 --> 00:21:13.769
Unh! Oh, god! Dean?!

00:21:18.068 --> 00:21:18.868
Dean?

00:21:20.568 --> 00:21:21.368
Are you with me?

00:21:23.568 --> 00:21:24.469
Yeah, I think so.

00:21:25.368 --> 00:21:28.168
I saw Sam. I saw him, Bobby.

00:21:28.668 --> 00:21:29.668
It was a vision.

00:21:29.969 --> 00:21:30.668
Yeah.

00:21:31.368 --> 00:21:33.769
I don't know how,
but -- But yeah.

00:21:34.368 --> 00:21:35.168
Whew!

00:21:36.168 --> 00:21:38.068
That was about as fun as
getting kicked in the jewels.

00:21:38.168 --> 00:21:39.168
What else did you see?

00:21:39.769 --> 00:21:42.668
Uh, there was a bell.

00:21:42.969 --> 00:21:43.668
What kind of bell?

00:21:45.568 --> 00:21:47.168
Um, like,
a big --

00:21:47.168 --> 00:21:50.668
A big bell with some
kind of engraving on it.

00:21:50.668 --> 00:21:51.269
I don't know.

00:21:51.269 --> 00:21:52.068
Engraving?

00:21:52.068 --> 00:21:53.168
Yeah.

00:21:53.168 --> 00:21:55.269
Was it a tree --
Like, an oak tree?

00:21:56.969 --> 00:21:57.969
Yeah, exactly.

00:21:59.568 --> 00:22:00.969
I know where Sam is.

00:22:19.668 --> 00:22:21.769
I-I'm not superman or anything.

00:22:21.769 --> 00:22:22.769
It's no big deal.

00:22:23.068 --> 00:22:24.868
You were in afghanistan
when this started?

00:22:25.068 --> 00:22:26.469
I started getting headaches,

00:22:27.568 --> 00:22:30.469
Then, uh, there was this accident.

00:22:30.769 --> 00:22:32.668
This guy flipped his
vehicle on a bad road,

00:22:33.068 --> 00:22:35.068
Got pinned underneath.

00:22:35.668 --> 00:22:37.269
I lifted it off him like it was nothing.

00:22:37.868 --> 00:22:41.469
E-Everybody said it was
a fluke adrenaline thing.

00:22:41.469 --> 00:22:42.769
But then you did it again, right?

00:22:42.769 --> 00:22:45.668
Bench-Press 800
pounds, stone-Cold calm.

00:22:47.269 --> 00:22:48.568
I never told anybody, of course.

00:22:48.568 --> 00:22:49.969
It's just too crazy.

00:22:50.568 --> 00:22:53.269
Yeah, well, crazy's relative.

00:22:54.068 --> 00:22:55.168
I'm starting to get that.

00:22:56.469 --> 00:22:57.269
Yeah.

00:22:59.168 --> 00:23:01.668
By the way, I, uh,
appreciate what you're doing.

00:23:02.868 --> 00:23:03.668
What am I doing?

00:23:04.368 --> 00:23:06.769
Keeping calm, keeping them calm,

00:23:06.868 --> 00:23:09.168
Especially considering how
freaked to hell you really are.

00:23:12.769 --> 00:23:14.668
I've been in some deep
crap before myself.

00:23:14.668 --> 00:23:15.668
I know the look.

00:23:23.168 --> 00:23:23.969
Want to know the truth?

00:23:24.969 --> 00:23:26.269
I got this brother, right?

00:23:27.068 --> 00:23:29.368
And he's always telling me how
he's gonna watch out for me,

00:23:29.368 --> 00:23:31.868
How everything's gonna be okay,
like I've been telling them.

00:23:32.368 --> 00:23:33.168
Yeah.

00:23:34.469 --> 00:23:35.868
I don't know if I believe it this time.

00:23:37.969 --> 00:23:39.168
I mean, the size
of what's coming --

00:23:41.368 --> 00:23:42.668
It's bigger than anyone's ever seen.

00:23:43.668 --> 00:23:46.769
I mean, it's gonna get bad,
and I-I don't know if --

00:23:46.769 --> 00:23:47.868
If we're gonna make it.

00:23:49.068 --> 00:23:50.769
It doesn't matter if we believe it.

00:23:51.668 --> 00:23:52.969
Only matters that they do.

00:24:24.168 --> 00:24:26.269
My horoscope said I shouldn't
have gotten out of bed.

00:24:31.068 --> 00:24:31.769
How you doing?

00:24:32.469 --> 00:24:33.368
Holding up?

00:24:33.368 --> 00:24:34.168
I'm okay.

00:24:35.668 --> 00:24:36.668
What about you?

00:24:36.969 --> 00:24:38.168
Not so okay.

00:24:40.469 --> 00:24:41.668
Why us, Sam?

00:24:42.868 --> 00:24:44.769
What did we do to deserve this?

00:24:45.269 --> 00:24:46.469
Just lucky, I guess.

00:24:46.969 --> 00:24:49.769
If it wasn't for bad luck,
wouldn't have no luck at all.

00:24:52.469 --> 00:24:53.868
Just can't wait for this all to be over

00:24:53.868 --> 00:24:56.469
So I can just pretend it never happened.

00:24:58.469 --> 00:25:01.368
Just want to curl up with
Brady and watch bad tv.

00:25:05.368 --> 00:25:06.269
What is it?

00:25:08.868 --> 00:25:10.668
Sam, do you

00:25:12.969 --> 00:25:14.269
Know something that I don't?

00:25:16.368 --> 00:25:17.068
Look, Ava.

00:25:20.769 --> 00:25:22.868
I'm sorry. I wish I didn't
have to tell you this

00:25:22.868 --> 00:25:23.168
Tell me what?

00:25:25.769 --> 00:25:28.668
When the demon broke in
to your house to take you,

00:25:31.368 --> 00:25:32.469
Your fianc?Didn't make it

00:25:34.068 --> 00:25:34.969
I'm sorry.

00:25:37.769 --> 00:25:39.668
No, it's...

00:26:16.568 --> 00:26:17.668
Jake, behind you!

00:26:18.068 --> 00:26:18.868
Howdy, Sam.

00:26:23.469 --> 00:26:24.269
I'm dreaming.

00:26:25.168 --> 00:26:28.769
What do you say you and
I take a little walk?

00:26:38.769 --> 00:26:42.168
You're awfully quiet, Sam.
You're not mad at me, are you?

00:26:43.668 --> 00:26:45.868
I'm gonna tear you to shreds, I swear.

00:26:46.368 --> 00:26:49.269
When you wake up, tiger,
you give it your best shot.

00:26:50.269 --> 00:26:51.168
Where's my brother?

00:26:51.168 --> 00:26:54.769
Quit worrying about Dean.
I'd worry more about yourself.

00:26:54.769 --> 00:26:56.269
What, you gonna kill me?

00:26:58.769 --> 00:27:00.868
I'm trying to help you.
That's why we're talking.

00:27:00.868 --> 00:27:02.469
You're the one i'm rooting for.

00:27:05.368 --> 00:27:06.469
What's that supposed to mean?

00:27:06.969 --> 00:27:09.568
Welcome to the miss america pageant.

00:27:09.568 --> 00:27:11.469
Why do you think you're here?

00:27:11.469 --> 00:27:12.969
This is a competition.

00:27:12.969 --> 00:27:17.168
Only one of you crazy kids is

00:27:17.168 --> 00:27:18.969
Gonna make it out of here alive.

00:27:18.969 --> 00:27:19.868
I thought we were
supposed to be --

00:27:19.868 --> 00:27:21.368
Soldiers in a coming war?

00:27:21.368 --> 00:27:24.868
That's true. You are.
But here's the thing.

00:27:27.269 --> 00:27:28.469
I don't need soldiers.

00:27:30.969 --> 00:27:34.868
I need soldier. I just need the one.

00:27:35.868 --> 00:27:36.368
Why?

00:27:36.368 --> 00:27:38.668
I couldn't just come out
and say that, could I, Sam?

00:27:38.668 --> 00:27:41.269
I had to let everyone think
they had a fighting chance.

00:27:41.269 --> 00:27:42.469
But what I need...

00:27:43.769 --> 00:27:44.769
Is a leader.

00:27:45.469 --> 00:27:46.568
To lead who?

00:27:48.868 --> 00:27:54.068
Oh, I've already got my army
-- Or I will soon, anyway.

00:27:54.469 --> 00:27:55.668
You son of a bitch.

00:27:55.668 --> 00:27:59.368
Honestly, i'm surprised
you hadn't guessed.

00:27:59.368 --> 00:28:02.469
I mean, why do you think so many
children flamed out already --

00:28:02.469 --> 00:28:05.668
Max Miller and Andy's
brother -- What's his name?

00:28:06.068 --> 00:28:08.769
They weren't strong enough.

00:28:09.368 --> 00:28:15.368
I'm looking for the best and
brightest of your generation.

00:28:16.668 --> 00:28:17.769
My generation?

00:28:18.068 --> 00:28:20.368
Well, there's other generations,

00:28:20.368 --> 00:28:21.969
But let's just worry about yours.

00:28:22.368 --> 00:28:23.868
That's why i'm here, Sam.

00:28:23.868 --> 00:28:26.068
I want to give you the inside track.

00:28:26.668 --> 00:28:30.068
You're tough, you're
smart, you're well-Trained,

00:28:30.568 --> 00:28:31.568
Thanks to your daddy.

00:28:32.168 --> 00:28:33.068
Sam.

00:28:35.469 --> 00:28:36.368
Sammy...

00:28:37.769 --> 00:28:38.868
You're my favorite.

00:28:39.469 --> 00:28:44.068
You ruined my life. You
killed everyone I love.

00:28:44.568 --> 00:28:46.769
The cost of doing business, i'm afraid.

00:28:47.868 --> 00:28:50.969
I mean, sweet, little jessica...

00:28:51.668 --> 00:28:53.068
She just had to die.

00:28:53.668 --> 00:28:57.168
You were all set to marry
that little, blond thing,

00:28:57.469 --> 00:29:00.168
Become a tax lawyer with
two kids, a beer gut,

00:29:00.168 --> 00:29:01.868
And a little mcmansion in the suburbs.

00:29:01.868 --> 00:29:04.168
I needed you sharp, on the road,

00:29:04.168 --> 00:29:07.969
Honing your skills
-- Your gifts.

00:29:08.368 --> 00:29:09.368
What about my mom?

00:29:10.368 --> 00:29:11.269
That was bad luck.

00:29:11.668 --> 00:29:12.368
Bad luck.

00:29:12.368 --> 00:29:15.469
She walked
in on us --

00:29:15.969 --> 00:29:17.269
Wrong place, wrong time.

00:29:17.868 --> 00:29:18.568
What does that mean?

00:29:18.568 --> 00:29:21.568
It wasn't about her. It was about you.

00:29:22.469 --> 00:29:23.969
It's always been about you.

00:29:25.469 --> 00:29:26.469
What?

00:29:31.269 --> 00:29:32.168
Well...

00:29:33.769 --> 00:29:37.769
Okay, you caught me
in a charitable mood.

00:29:38.469 --> 00:29:39.368
I'll show you.

00:29:41.668 --> 00:29:43.368
Look familiar? It should.

00:29:47.969 --> 00:29:51.068
Relax, Sam. This is just
a high-Def instant replay.

00:29:51.769 --> 00:29:52.769
Enjoy the show.

00:29:53.568 --> 00:29:54.469
John.

00:29:54.769 --> 00:29:55.269
Mom.

00:29:55.269 --> 00:29:56.269
Is he hungry?

00:29:58.469 --> 00:29:59.368
Shh.

00:30:00.769 --> 00:30:01.668
Okay.

00:30:01.668 --> 00:30:02.668
Wait, mom.

00:30:03.068 --> 00:30:04.368
Mom!

00:30:04.368 --> 00:30:06.269
What did I just tell you,
Sam? She can't hear you.

00:30:06.868 --> 00:30:07.969
This isn't real.

00:30:13.469 --> 00:30:14.469
What the hell are you doing to me?

00:30:14.769 --> 00:30:15.969
Better than mother's milk.

00:30:20.868 --> 00:30:22.668
Does this mean I have...

00:30:23.368 --> 00:30:24.269
Demon blood in me?

00:30:26.568 --> 00:30:27.668
Answer me!

00:30:30.969 --> 00:30:31.668
It's you.

00:30:31.969 --> 00:30:32.868
She knew you.

00:30:36.868 --> 00:30:37.668
No.

00:30:42.868 --> 00:30:43.969
No!

00:30:46.068 --> 00:30:47.668
I don't think you want
to see the rest of this.

00:30:48.969 --> 00:30:49.969
Sam, wake up.

00:30:51.969 --> 00:30:52.969
Ava's missing.

00:31:07.368 --> 00:31:08.668
I'll take the barn and the hotel.

00:31:09.269 --> 00:31:10.469
You take the houses. All right.

00:31:10.868 --> 00:31:11.969
Meet back here in 10 minutes, okay?

00:31:43.769 --> 00:31:45.769
Ava, where'd you go?

00:31:47.269 --> 00:31:48.668
Didn't you hear us yelling?

00:31:48.668 --> 00:31:49.568
Yeah, I heard you.

00:32:02.668 --> 00:32:03.469
What are you doing?

00:32:09.368 --> 00:32:10.168
Holy...

00:32:10.868 --> 00:32:13.368
Ah! Aah!

00:32:14.068 --> 00:32:14.868
Aah!

00:32:37.469 --> 00:32:40.269
Sam, I just found him like this!

00:32:40.668 --> 00:32:41.568
What happened?

00:32:41.969 --> 00:32:42.668
I don't know.

00:32:43.368 --> 00:32:44.368
How did that thing get in?

00:32:50.769 --> 00:32:51.568
Where were you?

00:32:51.868 --> 00:32:54.269
I just went to get some
water from the well.

00:32:54.269 --> 00:32:56.668
I was only gone, maybe,
like, two minutes.

00:32:58.868 --> 00:33:00.168
You shouldn't have gone outside.

00:33:00.868 --> 00:33:01.969
Ava, we have to stay in here.

00:33:05.769 --> 00:33:06.668
Who did that?

00:33:07.568 --> 00:33:08.769
I don't know.
Maybe Andy --

00:33:08.769 --> 00:33:09.868
Andy wouldn't do that.

00:33:11.769 --> 00:33:13.368
Ava, that line wasn't
broken when I left.

00:33:16.668 --> 00:33:17.368
Ava.

00:33:17.368 --> 00:33:18.368
What? You
don't think --

00:33:18.368 --> 00:33:20.469
I'll tell you what I think. Five months.

00:33:20.969 --> 00:33:23.269
You're the only one with all
that time you can't account for.

00:33:24.068 --> 00:33:25.168
And that headache you got...

00:33:27.068 --> 00:33:28.269
Right when the demon got Lily.

00:33:28.269 --> 00:33:29.668
What are you trying to say?

00:33:29.668 --> 00:33:30.568
What happened to you?

00:33:30.568 --> 00:33:31.568
Nothing!

00:33:42.769 --> 00:33:44.168
Had you going, though, didn't I?

00:33:47.168 --> 00:33:48.168
Yeah.

00:33:49.668 --> 00:33:53.068
I've been here a long
time, and not alone, either.

00:33:53.068 --> 00:33:57.568
People just keep showing
up -- Children, like us.

00:34:00.668 --> 00:34:02.568
Batches of three or four at a time.

00:34:02.568 --> 00:34:04.768
You killed them
-- All of them?

00:34:06.768 --> 00:34:08.668
I'm the undefeated heavyweight champ.

00:34:08.869 --> 00:34:09.969
Oh, my god.

00:34:10.268 --> 00:34:12.369
I don't think god has
much to do with this, Sam.

00:34:13.568 --> 00:34:14.469
How could you?

00:34:16.168 --> 00:34:17.768
I had no choice.

00:34:18.469 --> 00:34:19.568
It's me or them.

00:34:19.568 --> 00:34:21.969
After a while, it was easy.

00:34:22.469 --> 00:34:23.668
It was even kind of fun.

00:34:25.568 --> 00:34:26.668
I just stopped fighting it.

00:34:26.969 --> 00:34:27.768
Fighting what?

00:34:28.068 --> 00:34:29.568
Who we are, Sam.

00:34:30.469 --> 00:34:32.168
If you'd just quit your hand-Wringing

00:34:32.168 --> 00:34:33.369
And open yourself up,

00:34:33.369 --> 00:34:35.469
You have no idea what you can do.

00:34:35.469 --> 00:34:37.668
The learning curve is so fast.

00:34:37.668 --> 00:34:41.068
It's crazy, the switches
that just flip in your brain.

00:34:41.869 --> 00:34:45.568
I can't believe I started
out just having dreams.

00:34:48.068 --> 00:34:49.369
Do you know what I can do now?

00:34:50.168 --> 00:34:51.068
Control demons.

00:34:51.768 --> 00:34:54.168
Ah. You are quick on the draw.

00:35:00.168 --> 00:35:01.768
Yeah, i'm sorry, Sam, but...

00:35:03.068 --> 00:35:04.068
It's over.

00:35:33.568 --> 00:35:35.369
It looks like the rest
of the way's on foot.

00:35:42.268 --> 00:35:43.068
Let's go.

00:35:48.068 --> 00:35:49.168
I think we can make it out of here now.

00:35:49.768 --> 00:35:50.369
But the achiri demon.

00:35:50.369 --> 00:35:52.268
No, no, no, Ava was
summoning it, controlling it.

00:35:52.268 --> 00:35:53.568
It shouldn't come back
now that she's dead.

00:35:54.168 --> 00:35:55.068
We got to go.

00:35:56.168 --> 00:35:56.869
No. Not "we," Sam.

00:35:58.668 --> 00:36:00.668
Only one of us is getting
out of here. I'm sorry.

00:36:01.068 --> 00:36:02.469
What? I had a vision.

00:36:02.469 --> 00:36:04.268
That yellow-Eyed demon,
or whatever it was,

00:36:04.268 --> 00:36:05.168
He talked to me.

00:36:05.168 --> 00:36:06.268
He told me how it was.

00:36:06.268 --> 00:36:07.869
No, Jake, listen. You
can't listen to him.

00:36:07.869 --> 00:36:10.168
Sam, he's not letting us go.

00:36:10.168 --> 00:36:11.068
Only one.

00:36:11.369 --> 00:36:13.168
Now, we don't play
along, he'll kill us both.

00:36:13.969 --> 00:36:16.668
Now, I-I like you, man. I
do, but do the math, here.

00:36:16.668 --> 00:36:18.568
What good's it do for both of us to die?

00:36:19.068 --> 00:36:20.568
Now, I can get out of here,

00:36:20.568 --> 00:36:22.768
I get close to the demon,
I can kill the bastard.

00:36:22.768 --> 00:36:24.168
Come with me. We can kill him together.

00:36:24.168 --> 00:36:25.568
How do I know you won't turn on me?

00:36:26.268 --> 00:36:27.168
I won't.

00:36:27.168 --> 00:36:28.168
I don't know that.

00:36:31.369 --> 00:36:32.168
Okay, look.

00:36:45.869 --> 00:36:46.869
Just come with me, Jake.

00:36:48.268 --> 00:36:49.268
Don't do this.

00:36:49.869 --> 00:36:51.068
Don't play into what it wants.

00:37:06.369 --> 00:37:07.469
Okay.

00:37:10.268 --> 00:37:11.068
Ugh!

00:38:32.969 --> 00:38:33.969
Sam!

00:38:43.869 --> 00:38:44.668
Sam!

00:38:44.969 --> 00:38:45.869
Dean.

00:38:48.068 --> 00:38:49.168
Sam, look out!

00:38:51.568 --> 00:38:52.369
No!

00:39:03.369 --> 00:39:04.068
No. Sam.

00:39:04.768 --> 00:39:06.668
Whoa, Sam. Sam.

00:39:06.668 --> 00:39:07.469
Sam, hey.

00:39:09.668 --> 00:39:10.768
Hey, come here.

00:39:10.768 --> 00:39:11.369
Let me look at you.

00:39:15.568 --> 00:39:17.668
Hey, look. Look at me.
It's not even that bad.

00:39:18.168 --> 00:39:19.268
It's not even that bad, all right?

00:39:20.768 --> 00:39:21.568
Sammy?

00:39:21.969 --> 00:39:22.668
Sam!

00:39:22.668 --> 00:39:24.969
Hey, listen to me. We're
gonna patch you up, okay?

00:39:25.869 --> 00:39:26.668
You'll be good as new.

00:39:27.568 --> 00:39:28.469
Huh?

00:39:28.668 --> 00:39:29.568
I'm gonna take care of you.

00:39:29.568 --> 00:39:31.768
I got you. That's my job, right?

00:39:31.768 --> 00:39:34.369
Watch out for my
